          ]},
          { "type": "element", "tag": "div", "className": "concept-card", "children": [
            { "type": "element", "tag": "h4", "children": [{ "type": "text", "text": "第四类 · 综合/特长" }] },
            { "type": "element", "tag": "p", "children": [{ "type": "text", "text": "武术、体操、健美操、羽毛球、乒乓球等选一项。有校外特长者可在此发挥，无特长则选最易上手的项目。" }] }
